---
title: "GitHub merge gate (MergeGate.tla)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: open
    lg1: ready
    lg2: merged
    lg3: Breaks MergeBoundToJudgedPatch
    lg4: Path to the MergeBoundToJudgedPatch bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: No evaluation: 0 of 3 verdict kinds pass on the current patch
  s1: No evaluation: 1 of 3 verdict kinds pass on the current patch
  s2: No evaluation: 2 of 3 verdict kinds pass on the current patch
  s3: No evaluation: 3 of 3 verdict kinds pass on the current patch
  s4: Gate ready on the current patch
  s5: Gate ready, but the patch digest moved since
  s6: Merged on an unjudged patch
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a verdict is recorded
  s1 --> s2: a verdict is recorded
  s2 --> s3: a verdict is recorded
  s3 --> s4: mergeReadiness evaluates
  s4 --> s5: default branch moves, digest changes
  s5 --> s6: mergeThroughGithub merges
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 blue
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 blue
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 orange
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 orange
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 teal
  class s6 breaks
  class s6 bugPath
